  "title": "What's new in Low-Latency HLS",
  "description": "Apple has added Low-Latency extensions to the HTTP Live Streaming protocol that combine the quality and scalability of HLS with a stream delay of two seconds or less. Learn about the most recent developments in LL-HLS and how it allows you to make your video delivery competitive with broadcast and improve social media integration. For an overview of Low-Latency HLS, watch “Introducing Low-Latency HLS” from WWDC19.",
